	"SOUTHSIDE RECORDS", "HALIFAX HARDWARE", "BLANDFORD BAKERY", "WALNUT HILL BOOKS",
	"RIVER CITY PRESS", "THE PADDLEWHEEL", "BRICK & BRINE", "SEVENTH STREET"
]
